  "details": "MMD Worlds and the likes need questionable workarounds to take control over an avatar via stations fully, else after seating the head is given tracking control back.\n\nIt would be very nice to get that functionality in, so we can make these world systems more officially.\n\nThis can be either by exposing the behavior in the World SDK or by providing a new checkbox in the VRC Station component allowing to take over full control over the avatar.\n\nRepro:\n\nWorld wrld_235a39fc-bf82-4787-8d45-85b67b828e31\n\nInteracting with the yellow cuboid will run the system with the workaround, interacting with the red one will run it without and break.",
